flutter_d4rt
pub package License: MIT

A WIP Flutter package that provides a Dart interpreter based on the d4rt package. This allows you to execute Dart code dynamically at runtime and create Flutter widgets on-the-fly, enabling dynamic UI generation, and runtime code execution.

